			"title": "[Feat] Camera shake",
			"description": "",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "d43f5ef7-ed2f-4954-a345-e83b1501cc63",
			"title": "[Feat] Player death",
			"description": "A player should die only after the round's become still. This causes an explosion, and a bed to pop up instead of the player. When all players die, the game ends.",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "1021925b-870c-41b4-9db2-6ac202acebce",
			"title": "[Feat] Separate explosion from projectile",
			"description": "It's become clear that explosions can occur outside of projectiles, and should thus be independent and more customizable. A player's death causes an explosion, but it's not relevant to a projectile.\n\nAn explosion should have the same attributes as it currently has on a projectile.\n- Damage (range & amount)\n- Knockback (range & force)\n\nThis should also make it easier for the camera to know what to track and how important it is.",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "fd658690-f9be-40be-a833-ded5a72ec2de",
			"title": "[Bug] Pickuppable slides down slopes",
			"description": "",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "b46728ea-8587-4e8b-9176-9ed8ea0c82a6",
			"title": "[Feat] Weapon ammo",
			"description": "",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "577303c7-5a7d-4726-8073-a8a9d924e8af",
			"title": "[Feat] Improve timings between turns",
			"description": "Current times to wait between turns are inconsistent.\nEvery turn end should last at least 3 seconds to let the player process, even if nothing happened.",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "f6e1cbe8-7ea2-47c6-a2d4-c7f96e1f6d48",
			"title": "[Feat] Damage of players should happen after business ends",
			"description": "Players should accumulate damage they take in the turn. This damage should then be applied only after business has finished, and before the next turn starts.\n\nIf a player takes enough damage to be marked for death, the player should die immediately.",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "5488e8f4-13ab-4b5b-a3b4-e3f6ef15302f",
			"title": "[Feat] Add turn timer",
			"description": "A single turn should be maximum of 40 seconds. When the timer runs out, the active player is deactivated, and turn finishes.\n",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "61377157-01c9-4b96-a77f-9d720aae390e",
			"title": "[Refactor] Control player camera through the player manager",
			"description": "",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "6a4ae222-d31a-4f6a-9ef4-81460922f2f0",
			"title": "[Feat] Improve pickuppable spawn",
			"description": "Pickuppables should spawn a little above their intended spawn point.",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "68bbfbb8-2866-43e2-b4b0-213b26940b49",
			"title": "[Feat] Winner should be displayed",
			"description": "When a winner is declared, the camera should shift to a random player of the winning team. Each player of that team should celebrate.",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "abd5c689-687e-4b51-afbf-4489f6fe2d7b",
			"title": "[Feat] Fall damage",
			"description": "A player should take damage (and thus end turn) if they fall at a too high velocity.\n",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "60c55b7c-d743-416e-841d-1b486158e205",
			"title": "New task",
			"description": "",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "26d5f9f0-0078-48f2-8306-c5e54c707ae8",
			"title": "[Feat] Quick tutorial on how the game works",
			"description": "Before the player enters the match for the first time, a quick tutorial should be played to demonstrate the game's capabilities.\n\nSimple polygon with closed off walls. One player versus another player.\n\nShow how to shoot rocket launcher, emphasis on charging.\n\nShow how to move around.\n\nShow how to jump.\n\nShow how to pick up pickuppables.\n\nExample:\nPlayer starts, another player is at the other end. First show player how to move by displaying arrows, considered complete when pressed each at least once. Then show how to jump by displaying the up arrow. Then auto equip the rocket launcher, show to how fire at other player. Then show how to use inventory. Use a grapple hook. Lastly, pick up crate and unlock revolver, shoot and consider it done. Move on to game.\n\nDo not display again if already saw once.",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "38fcff7a-c781-4ce4-b826-61552b11b434",
			"title": "[Feat] Improve projectiles flying out of the map",
			"description": "Easiest fix is to limit the camera's movement to a certain amount beyond the polygon's bounds.\n\nMake projectile destruction graceful",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "08abd116-1bd9-4a00-a3ca-dcf5fd62715b",
			"title": "[Feat] Player death on fall off map",
			"description": "A player should die when falling off the map. When hitting the water, player should enter a water state in which the player slowly sinks, and is dead + eliminated from team. Turn ends afterwards.",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "f08c4f40-bea2-442b-aa32-262c5323b59d",
			"title": "[Feat] Enemy AI",
			"description": "Game should be playable by playing against an AI. This AI should be simple but consistent. A team can be marked as AI, if the player is of an AI team, an algorithm takes a few frames to check best possible weapon usage by projecting invisible collision points and simulating a weapon's launch or shot.\n\nAI takes the best result and executes.",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "2be0c329-8644-4573-b810-7efea70ddae4",
			"title": "New task",
			"description": "",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		}
